    "op": {
      "methodology_note": "Outpatient appointments have no Inpatient/Day Case split to sum across (a single appointment type), unlike IPDC. Time bands grouped into Under 6 / 6-12 / 12+ months by starting wait length, since NTPF's own band boundaries changed at the same point (2022+ files use 0-6/6-12/12-18/18+ months; pre-2021 files use 0-3/3-6/6-9/9-12/12+ months) and are not directly comparable band-for-band. Outpatient data is only available from 2018 onward \u2014 NTPF has not published OP data for 2014-2017, unlike IPDC which covers the full range.",
      "known_limitations": "Adult and Child are NTPF's own classification (no further age breakdown is published). A hospital with no patients in a population shows an empty chart for that toggle rather than being hidden.",
